{
  "repo": "EH3D-CORE-LIBS",
  "ecosystem": "eh3d",
  "tagline": "Tolerant readers of Gerber, Excellon and G-code for the programs of the suite.",
  "description": "EH3D-CORE-LIBS is a Rust workspace with three readers that share one small crate (diagnostics with a stable code, units, number limits, the reading of bytes) and have no other dependency: Gerber RS-274X, Excellon drill files and G-code with a modal interpreter. Each takes text from a person who may be careless or hostile and returns the data plus diagnostics with line numbers; none of them panics. Four programs of the suite use them (EH3D-CAM-DEBUGGER, EH3D-STENCILCAM, EH3D-GERBERVIEWER and EH3D-ISOCAM). They draw nothing and move nothing.",
  "columns": [
